ition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lump's Nemesis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lump%27s_Nemesis_(Condition)\" title=\"Lump's Nemesis (Condition)\">Lump's Nemesis</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ogre\" title=\"Ogre\">Ogres</a> deal additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage when throwing objects at this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Lump_the_Enlightened\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lump the Enlightened\">Lump the Enlightened</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715155515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.089 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.094 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2477/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35095/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12784/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1423991/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   80.406      1 -total\n 77.94%   62.670     33 Template:Trim\n 69.38%   55.789      1 Template:Feature_page\n 30.56%   24.576      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 30.12%   24.221      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 28.97%   23.291      1 Template:Ambox\n 14.83%   11.922      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.57%   10.108      1 Template:Condition\n 10.49%    8.435      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  9.27%    7.455      3 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47630-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715155515 and revision id 377270. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}